        "description": "Postnatal growth retardation",
        "category": "minor",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      },
      {
        "id": "neurological-impairment",
        "description": "Severe intellectual disability and hypotonia",
        "category": "major",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": true
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of congenital microcephaly, characteristic facial dysmorphism, skeletal anomalies, and neurological impairment",
    "notes": "Diagnosis is primarily clinical; genetic testing may assist but no specific gene identified."
